Description: Screenshot: pictures and recordings of the screen
 The palOS Screenshot bar: capture the entire screen, one window or a
 selected portion, or record the screen (MP4) with sound from the
 microphone, the computer or both. Opened with the Print Screen key;
 everything is saved to the Desktop.
